{"unit_id":"tenglongbohai__dsh-paddle-ocr#card-zh","repo":"tenglongbohai/dsh-paddle-ocr","commit":"edc54334daad97ed00b1c0406d8d3fe7416ae599","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-paddle-ocr 是一款 DSH OCR 视觉插件，面向 Web、TUI、桌面及移动端等 DSH 客户端。它注册 paddle_ocr 工具，并为 Agnes、DeepSeek、MiniMax、GLM 和 Mimo 提供 PaddleOCR 视觉模型变体。主要功能包括识别本地图片或图片 URL、提取文字与版面坐标、将识别结果交给文本模型继续回答，以及自动略过已支持图像输入的模型。适合需要用纯文本模型处理截图和文档的 DSH 用户。使用前需要配置 PADDLE_OCR_TOKEN，识别内容会提交至 PaddleOCR 服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:8-15","lib/index.js:68-87","lib/index.js:184-205"]}
{"unit_id":"tenglongbohai__dsh-paddle-ocr#card-en","repo":"tenglongbohai/dsh-paddle-ocr","commit":"edc54334daad97ed00b1c0406d8d3fe7416ae599","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-paddle-ocr adds PaddleOCR to DSH with a paddle_ocr tool and vision variants for Agnes, DeepSeek, MiniMax, GLM, and Mimo. It recognizes local images and URLs, returns text and layout blocks, and skips models that accept images. Configure PADDLE_OCR_TOKEN; images go to PaddleOCR.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:8-15","lib/index.js:68-87","lib/index.js:184-205"]}
