{"unit_id":"tenglongbohai__dsh-paddle-ocr#feature-1","repo":"tenglongbohai/dsh-paddle-ocr","commit":"edc54334daad97ed00b1c0406d8d3fe7416ae599","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-paddle-ocr 的功能「图片 OCR 工具」：调用 paddle_ocr 工具并传入本地文件路径或图片 URL，可选识别提示词和坐标开关，返回识别文字及文字块位置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:13-24","lib/index.js:50-65"]}
{"unit_id":"tenglongbohai__dsh-paddle-ocr#feature-2","repo":"tenglongbohai/dsh-paddle-ocr","commit":"edc54334daad97ed00b1c0406d8d3fe7416ae599","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-paddle-ocr 的功能「文本模型视觉变体」：插件为配置的多个提供商注册 PaddleOCR 包装模型，在模型列表中呈现视觉变体；已经支持图片输入的模型会被跳过。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:68-87","lib/index.js:101-125"]}
{"unit_id":"tenglongbohai__dsh-paddle-ocr#feature-3","repo":"tenglongbohai/dsh-paddle-ocr","commit":"edc54334daad97ed00b1c0406d8d3fe7416ae599","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-paddle-ocr 的功能「聊天图片转文字」：当用户消息含图片时，插件调用 OCR 并把识别文本替换为消息内容，再转交原提供商的文本模型生成回答。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:143-151","lib/index.js:159-181"]}
{"unit_id":"tenglongbohai__dsh-paddle-ocr#feature-4","repo":"tenglongbohai/dsh-paddle-ocr","commit":"edc54334daad97ed00b1c0406d8d3fe7416ae599","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-paddle-ocr 的功能「识别结果与版面坐标」：工具结果包含识别文本和文字块；可关闭坐标返回，结果展示会列出最多十个文字块的位置与片段。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:25-48","lib/index.js:50-65"]}
{"unit_id":"tenglongbohai__dsh-paddle-ocr#caveat-1","repo":"tenglongbohai/dsh-paddle-ocr","commit":"edc54334daad97ed00b1c0406d8d3fe7416ae599","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-paddle-ocr 使用前须知：需要设置 PADDLE_OCR_TOKEN；本地文件副本会写入系统临时目录，图片或文件会发送到 PaddleOCR API 进行识别。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:4","lib/index.js:216-237"]}
